<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="SJ Powertech privacy policy."><PageHero title="Privacy policy" text="How SJ Powertech handles information shared with us."/><article class="shell max-w-3xl py-20 text-slate-600"><p>Last updated: July 2026</p><h2 class="heading !text-3xl">Information we collect</h2><p>We collect the information you provide when contacting us, including your name, business contact details and enquiry details. We use this information to respond to you and provide relevant services.</p><h2 class="heading !mt-10 !text-3xl">How we use information</h2><p>Information is used for communication, service delivery, improving our website and meeting legal obligations. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2 class="heading !mt-10 !text-3xl">Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a class="font-bold text-navy" href="mailto:info@sjpowertech.com">info@sjpowertech.com</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
